    m_Untranslated: "<b>1</b>.  Pop out and resize the video window above so that the text is easy to read, then press <b>Esc</b> to pop the window back in. \n\n<b>2</b>.  Select <b>Need Help?</b> to expand the FAQ section, then select it again to collapse it."
