  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>1</b>.  Expand and watch the video above.


      <b>2</b>.  In the <b>Project</b> window, open the <b>Assets</b> > <b>Prefabs</b> folder.


      <b>Important</b>: Single-click, don''t double-click, <b>PlayerRobot</b> (<a href="https://learn.unity.com/tutorial/671be8afedbc2a0105a17c0e#671bf065edbc2a0105919b3b">Help</a>).


      <b>3</b>.  Drag the <b>PlayerRobot</b> asset from the <b>Project</b> window into the <b>Scene</b> view and onto the white ground in your scene.'
